  "dataCollectedTitle": "What data does the app use?",
  "dataCollectedBody": "The server uses account and university identifiers, consent decisions and policy version, session answers and results, and referral records. Daily feeling entries are optional. Downloaded resources do not require personal notes.",
  "dataPurposeTitle": "Why is this data used?",
  "dataPurposeBody": "To provide the service, save progress and history, track support requests, enforce access rights, and audit operations. Research participation is separate and refusing it does not block service. Daily feelings are not used to calculate diagnosis or risk.",
  "dataSharingTitle": "Access and sharing",
  "dataSharingBody": "Student records are scoped to their identity and university. Administration shows directories, referral status, and aggregates without individual answers. Referrals require separate sharing consent. The current preview does not deliver referrals to external providers.",
  "dataChoicesTitle": "Your choices and retention",
  "dataChoicesBody": "You can change research consent, withdraw service consent, and remove today's feeling. Withdrawal does not automatically delete prior records. Retention periods, deletion requests, and the official contact await university policy. Tokens, answers, and results are not stored locally; only published public resources can be downloaded.",
